python2-pyliblo (python wrapper for the liblo OSC library)

pyliblo is a Python wrapper for the liblo Open Sound Control
library. It supports almost the complete functionality of liblo,
allowing you to send and receive OSC messages using a nice and simple
Python API.

This is a legacy version, the last one which supports Python 2.
The command-line utilities send_osc and dump_osc are not included; see
python3-pyliblo for those.
